	* 7.3-0:
	- Initial release for Linux 7.3 with full Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu) hardware support
	- Iris: migrated SM8150 video decoding to upstream 7.3 VPU2 platform architecture
	- FastRPC: updated SDSP high-IOVA translation workaround and attach PDR helpers for Linux 7.3 soc_data
	- DRM: adapted panel blank notify worker to atomic bridge callbacks
	- Geni serial: integrated level-triggered IRQ masking for BT stability across suspend
	- Audio: SM8150 machine driver with 24-bit mic capture and quad CS35L41 amplifier routing
	- Power: PM8150B BMS charger stack, LN8000, and IDTP9418 wireless stylus charging
	- Input: Novatek NT36523 touchscreen and official Xiaomi keyboard
	- DTS: verified sm8150-xiaomi-nabu.dtb compilation with native 7.3 dtc
